WITNESS IDENTIFICATION:
- Name: Ramesh Kumar, S/o Harish Chandra
- Age: 44 Years | Occupation: Shopkeeper (General Store, Sector 4 Saket)
- Address: Shop No. 12, Market Complex, Sector 4, Saket, Delhi
- Date of Statement Recording: 13/08/2026

STATEMENT DEPOSITION:
"I, Ramesh Kumar, state on oath that on the night of 12th August 2026 at around 09:25 PM, I was closing my general store. I saw Vinod Mehta arguing loudly with accused Rajesh Kumar near streetlight pole #4.

Rajesh Kumar was holding a thick manila folder containing disputed property land deeds. I heard Rajesh Kumar shout: 'These papers are mine now, you will get nothing!' Shortly after, I saw Rajesh Kumar strike Vinod Mehta. Vinod fell to the ground bleeding. Rajesh Kumar grabbed the briefcase containing cash property proceeds and fled towards the main highway in a white sedan.

I ran to assist Vinod Mehta and called the PCR van immediately at 09:34 PM. I can clearly identify accused Rajesh Kumar."

RECORDED BY:
- Inspector R. Sharma (Investigating Officer, Saket PS)
- Witness Signature: [Ramesh Kumar]
